  "body": "It refers to either a Document, or a WorkerGlobalScope (or a WorkletGlobalScope?).\r\n\r\nBut, I think we could probably just replace it with the MessagePort's relevant global in most cases? Especially if we were able to make them owned by Windows instead of Documents. (Switching that might have implications for the initial about:blank transition, though.)",
